# VS Code REST Client: log in via auth.rest first, the session cookie is reused here

### Favorites
GET http://localhost:3001/api/lists/favorites

### Watch later
GET http://localhost:3001/api/lists/watch-later

### Add a movie to favorites (idempotent)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/lists/favorites/movie/155
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 155,
  "type": "movie",
  "title": "The Dark Knight",
  "year": 2008,
  "rating": 8.5,
  "genre": ["Action", "Crime"],
  "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg",
  "description": "Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime.",
  "language": "en"
}

### Remove it
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/lists/favorites/movie/155

### Import old localStorage lists
POST http://localhost:3001/api/lists/import
Content-Type: application/json

{ "favorites": [], "watch-later": [] }
